# Dam (Arkhangelsk). Plan language: modding/bot.md.
# Objectives: 0 neutralise all alarms (tags 0-3, SA+), 1 install covert modem (flag 0x100, 00),
#             2 intercept data backup (flag 0x400, 00), 3 bungee jump from platform (flag 0x1000, all).
